WEBVTT

00:04:58.848 --> 00:05:01.006
especially when I heard the applause,

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:03.954
and I knew right there,
when I was six, I said,

00:05:03.978 --> 00:05:05.144
"That's for me."

00:05:05.168 --> 00:05:06.680
(Laughter)

00:05:06.704 --> 00:05:08.007
At six, you're not thinking

00:05:08.031 --> 00:05:10.142
that's going to be
a career of your lifetime,

00:05:10.166 --> 00:05:12.458
but that was perfect for that moment.

00:05:12.482 --> 00:05:15.585
I danced my way through school,
and through college,

00:05:15.609 --> 00:05:19.006
and it still didn't dawn on me
that that's what I actually wanted to do.

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:20.641
I went to an audition,

00:05:20.665 --> 00:05:22.379
which I was dreadful in --

00:05:22.403 --> 00:05:25.418
it's the only audition
I've had in my life --

00:05:25.442 --> 00:05:27.498
and when I was let go
from that audition --

00:05:27.522 --> 00:05:30.514
because I thought when they were saying,
"Thank you very much,"